'''Supporting Pillars''' are important parts of scenery in the [[Theatre of Blood]] [[raid]]. They are found when fighting the first phase of [[Verzik Vitur]]. When fighting Verzik, players stand behind these pillars to prevent her from attacking them.

These pillars have a certain amount of hitpoints, and when these hitpoints reach zero, they collapse. When this happens, all players standing directly adjacent to the pillars will get damaged and stunned.

When [[Verzik]]'s phase one is ended and she transitions to phase two, all pillars in the room collapse, and players standing adjacent to a pillar will be damaged and stunned.

